<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19752" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βειέλοπες:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάντες</span>, used as crowns for victors at
		Sparta, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεικάδες</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the skins of animals which die naturally</i> (
				Lacon.
			), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεικάσθων:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ὀλίγον προβάς</span>, Id. (leg.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιβάσθων</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βείκατι</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β</span>
			=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ</span>), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκοσι</span>
			 (
				Lacon.
			), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βείκηλα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νωχελῆ, ἀχρεῖα</span> (
				Lacon.
			), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βειλαρμόστας</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βειλάρχας</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝιλ-</span>
			 (
				Tarent.
			), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βείλομαι</span></b> , 
				Boeot.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούλομαι</span>
			 (q. v.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βείομαι</span></b> ,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βείω</span></b> , v.
			sub <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέομαι.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
